/* 榜单用户资料半屏（运动榜 / 微信步数榜共用）。样式与运动榜原内联版一致。 */
.u-mask {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 1200;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
}
.u-sheet {
  width: 100%;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 24rpx 24rpx 0 0;
  padding: 28rpx 28rpx calc(28rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  animation: u-sheet-up 0.2s ease;
}
@keyframes u-sheet-up {
  from { transform: translateY(24rpx); opacity: 0.6; }
  to { transform: none; opacity: 1; }
}
.u-tip {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 80rpx 0;
  color: #8a93a6;
  font-size: 26rpx;
}
.u-tip-tap {
  color: #2b6cf6;
}
.u-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 20rpx;
}
.u-avatar-wrap {
  position: relative;
  flex: none;
  width: 96rpx;
  height: 96rpx;
}
.u-avatar {
  width: 96rpx;
  height: 96rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #f2f3f5;
}
.u-avatar-text {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  color: #fff;
  background: #64748f;
  font-size: 36rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.u-badge {
  position: absolute;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 8rpx;
  width: 32rpx;
  height: 32rpx;
}
.u-info {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
}
.u-name {
  font-size: 32rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #1f2329;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.u-sub {
  margin-top: 6rpx;
  font-size: 23rpx;
  color: #8a93a6;
}
.u-close {
  flex: none;
  width: 56rpx;
  height: 56rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  color: #8a93a6;
  font-size: 30rpx;
}
.u-section-title {
  margin: 28rpx 0 14rpx;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #1f2329;
}
.u-stats {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  background: #f7f8fa;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  padding: 12rpx 0;
}
.u-stat {
  width: 25%;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 12rpx 0;
}
.u-num {
  font-size: 32rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #2b6cf6;
}
.u-label {
  margin-top: 4rpx;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: #667080;
}
.u-avatar-hover {
  opacity: 0.85;
}
.u-stats-hidden {
  padding: 40rpx 24rpx;
  text-align: center;
  background: #f7f8fa;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  color: #8a93a6;
  font-size: 24rpx;
}

/* 头像大图预览 */
.avatar-viewer {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 1300;
  background: #000;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}
.avatar-viewer-img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
}
